# Lawyer AI (Herr Müller)

## Entry

- Tab `lawyer` → `LawyerAIPage.jsx` (full-height panel in `Dashboard`).
- Wrapped by `GuideProvider` with `activeModule="lawyer"`.

## Invocation

- `lib/lawyer/invokeMueller.js` → `appApi.integrations.Core.InvokeLLM`.
- System prompt: `lib/lawyer/herrMuellerPrompt.js` (13 domains, DE/EN, safety disclaimer).
- Demo fallback: `lib/lawyer/demoResponses.js` when API key missing (detects „Herr Müller“, „MUELLER“, „BizStart“ in prompt).

## Case model

- `lib/lawyer/caseStore.js` — localStorage cases with summaries timeline.
- `caseStore`: `ensureCase`, `addSummary`, `listCases`, `createNewCase`.
- Saved messages: `appApi.entities.SavedLawyerMessage`.

## UI components

| Component | Role |
|-----------|------|
| `CategoryPicker.jsx` | 13 Fachbereiche |
| `QuickPrompts.jsx` | Starter cards |
| `DocumentPicker.jsx` | Attach Docs entities |
| `LawyerAIArchive.jsx` | History — use **SafeMarkdown** |
| `CaseTimeline.jsx` | Per-case summaries |
| `ContractQuickDraft.jsx` | Short contract snippets |
| `MessageActions.jsx` | Copy/save actions |

## Markdown

All assistant output: **`SafeMarkdown`** only.

## Disclaimers

- Not a licensed Rechtsanwalt / Steuerberater.
- `SAFETY_DISCLAIMER_DE` in prompt; surface in UI where adding new advice surfaces.

## Export

`lib/lawyer/exportTranscript.js` — conversation PDF/text export.

## Patterns

```javascript
// ✅ Language detection
import { detectLanguage, SAFETY_DISCLAIMER_DE } from '@/lib/lawyer/herrMuellerPrompt'

// ❌ Do not present outputs as binding legal or tax advice
```

## Full-height layout

`Dashboard` sets `fullHeight` + `app-panel-full` when `activeTab === 'lawyer'` — preserve when changing layout.
